        },
        {
          "text": "Njeeyo milao ambeta Jehova njaakalailila bana ba-Israyeli kumulomo wa-Musa kumagezi aa-Moabu kunkomwe ya-Jordano iilangene a-Jeriko.",
          "type": "text",
